{
  "message": "The tasks show references, not a playable core, so they don’t yet support the slice. Mia has joined, but only Alex’s stated 40–60 hours can carry this plan. Before approving, narrow to one test area and replace the trailer work with playable tests. I’ll see you after the first sprint and look forward to your build and devlog posts ;)",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvun2x2600jwcsz8e6von2yr",
      "kind": "offGoal",
      "note": "Replace the trailer storyboard with a tide-and-sailing test scenario players can follow: a trailer would not prove the playable core.",
      "suggestion": null
    }
  ],
  "add": [
    "By the end of week one, make a boat controllable in one rough test area and share a playable build.",
    "During weeks two and three, add the tide loop and the simplest workable co-op sailing setup, then share a build with joining instructions.",
    "In week four, have five players try the tide-and-sailing scenario and record what worked, what failed, and what to change in a shared playtest report."
  ],
  "goal": {
    "fit": "narrow",
    "note": "The gap between references and a two-island slice is common and fixable within this checkpoint. Use this goal: A rough playable prototype of the tide loop and co-op sailing in one test area, tested by five players, with findings recorded.",
    "stage": {
      "inside": true,
      "note": ""
    }
  }
}

